<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/headermenu') %>

<div class="jumbotron in-ban service">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="ban-text">
			<div class="updates">Speed & Scalability</div>
			<h1>Ruby on Rails Performance Tuning</h1>
		</div>
	</div>
</div>

<div id="content" class="service-wrap">
	<section class="breadcrumb-wrap">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<nav aria-label="breadcrumb" class="brd">
					<ol class="breadcrumb">
						<li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Home", root_path %></li>
						<li class="breadcrumb-item"><%= link_to "Services", services_index_path %></li>
						<li class="breadcrumb-item active" aria-current="page">Performance Tuning</li>
					</ol>
				</nav>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="row-am first-sec">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="main-heading wow fadeInDown animated" style="visibility: visible; animation-name: fadeInDown;">
					<h1>Optimize Performance for Speed & Scale</h1>
				</div>
				<p>Transform slow Rails applications into high-performance systems that handle millions of requests efficiently. Our performance tuning experts identify bottlenecks, optimize database queries, implement strategic caching, and fine-tune infrastructure to deliver blazing-fast response times and exceptional scalability for your business-critical applications.</p>
			</div>

			<div class="about-two-part">
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-left">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser1.png') %>" alt="Performance Analysis">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Performance Profiling & Analysis</div>
							<p>Comprehensive application profiling to identify slow queries, memory leaks, and performance bottlenecks using New Relic, Scout APM, and custom tools.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-right">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser2.png') %>" alt="Database Optimization">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Database Query Optimization</div>
							<p>Optimize SQL queries, add strategic indexes, eliminate N+1 queries, and implement efficient eager loading for dramatic performance improvements.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="about-two-part">
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-left">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser3.png') %>" alt="Caching Strategies">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Strategic Caching Implementation</div>
							<p>Implement multi-level caching strategies with Redis, Memcached, fragment caching, and CDN integration for optimal performance.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 about-two-inner-right">
					<div class="both">
						<div class="about-left-img">
							<img src="<%= asset_path('ser4.png') %>" alt="Infrastructure Scaling">
						</div>
						<div class="about-right-cont">
							<div class="about-title">Infrastructure Optimization</div>
							<p>Optimize server configuration, implement load balancing, configure auto-scaling, and fine-tune application servers for peak performance.</p>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="about-us-second" class="service row-am">
		<div class="container">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="col-md-6 left all">
					<img src="<%= asset_path('about-img.png') %>" alt="Performance Tuning">
				</div>
				<div class="col-md-6 right">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-speed-meter"></i>Our Optimization Approach</div>
					<p>We employ a systematic, data-driven methodology to identify and eliminate performance bottlenecks, ensuring sustainable improvements that scale with your growth.</p>
					<ul>
						<li>Application performance monitoring and profiling</li>
						<li>Database query optimization and indexing strategies</li>
						<li>N+1 query elimination and eager loading</li>
						<li>Redis and Memcached caching implementation</li>
						<li>Fragment and Russian doll caching</li>
						<li>Background job optimization with Sidekiq</li>
						<li>Asset pipeline and front-end optimization</li>
						<li>CDN integration and static asset delivery</li>
						<li>Server and infrastructure tuning</li>
						<li>Load testing and capacity planning</li>
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="row-am service-new">
		<div class="container ser-new-inner">
			<div class="row">
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-database"></i>Database Performance</div>
					<p>Optimize PostgreSQL, MySQL, and MongoDB queries, implement connection pooling, partition large tables, and design efficient database schemas for optimal read/write performance.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-lightning-ray"></i>Response Time Reduction</div>
					<p>Reduce average response times from seconds to milliseconds through strategic optimizations, enabling better user experience and higher conversion rates.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="service-single">
					<div class="ser-title"><i class="icofont-chart-growth"></i>Scalability Engineering</div>
					<p>Design applications that scale horizontally, handle traffic spikes gracefully, and maintain performance under load through architectural improvements and infrastructure optimization.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/sec8interestedblock') %>
</div>

<%= render(:partial => 'layouts/footerjsblock') %>
